  "rationale": "Disabling DADA2 taxonomic classification and selecting the supported Kraken2 Greengenes 13.5 database activates the Kraken2 classification subworkflow and makes its taxonomy the preferred input for QIIME2 downstream analysis, without disabling DADA2 ASV generation or the independently configured QIIME2 classifier. The changed taxonomy propagates through taxonomic filtering, abundance exports, diversity analyses, differential abundance analyses, R objects and reporting. Kraken2 is explicitly excluded from the taxonomy summary tables, so the surviving QIIME2 taxonomy summary and its Parquet conversion remain unaffected."
